#question(title: [Definition of odd and even], centered: true)[
  Write a definition of “odd integer" and
  “even integer".

  #v(1fr)

  #slide-block(title: [Definition])[
    Let $x in ZZ$. We say that $x$ is odd
    when ...
    + $x = 2 a + 1$ ?
    + $display(forall a in ZZ comma x = 2 a + 1)$?
    + $display(exists a in ZZ " s.t. " x = 2 a + 1)$?
  ]

  #v(1fr)
]
